  m_text: 'Grab the CPU and drag it to the motherboard''s socket until the green guide
    appears.


    Place it gently without forcing it.


    (Reminder: In a real-life
    simulation, the CPU must be handled with care because its structure is very sensitive
    and can be easily damaged.)



'
