  m_text: "Reminder: Ensure the SSD M.2 type (SATA or NVMe) is compatible with  motherboard.\n\nIdentify
    SSD M2 slot on the motherboard (The M.2 slot is usually near the RAM slots or
    PCIe slots. It may have a label like M.2_1 or M.2_2.)\n\nGrab the M.2 SSD then
    attach to the slot carefully. \n\n\n\n\n"
