  m_text: "The hard disk is the computer's storage device. Usually a traditional
    hard disk drive (HDD) is used in combination with a solid state drive (SSD) for
    capacity and performance, using the ssd as the operating system's boot drive.
    \n\nNVMe M.2 SSD is newer type of SSD fastest storage type, connecting directly
    to the motherboard, perfect for gaming and professional use.\n"
